WEBVTT

00:10:58.359 --> 00:11:01.835
They are stories invented and maintained

00:11:01.859 --> 00:11:05.192
by the powerful wizards we call lawyers.

00:11:05.216 --> 00:11:06.661
(Laughter)

00:11:06.685 --> 00:11:10.104
And what do corporations do all day?

00:11:10.128 --> 00:11:12.981
Mostly, they try to make money.

00:11:13.411 --> 00:11:14.744
Yet, what is money?

00:11:14.768 --> 00:11:19.934
Again, money is not an objective reality;
it has no objective value.

00:11:19.958 --> 00:11:23.275
Take this green piece
of paper, the dollar bill.

00:11:23.299 --> 00:11:25.676
Look at it -- it has no value.

00:11:25.700 --> 00:11:27.934
You cannot eat it, you cannot drink it,

00:11:27.958 --> 00:11:29.250
you cannot wear it.

00:11:29.633 --> 00:11:33.674
But then came along
these master storytellers --